      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of proceeds We intend to use the net proceeds from this offering for working capital and general corporate purposes. See \u201cUse of Proceeds\u201d on page S-33 of this prospectus supplement. Risk factors Investing in our securities involves a high degree of risk. For a discussion of factors you should consider carefully before deciding to invest in our securities, see the information contained in or incorporated by reference under the heading \u201cRisk Factors\u201d beginning on page S-21 of this prospectus supplement, on page 20 of the accompanying prospectus, and in the other documents incorporated by reference into this prospectus supplement. Listing Our Class A ordinary shares are listed on Nasdaq under the symbol \u201cEPOW.\u201d Field: Page; Sequence: 31 S- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo 20 Field: /Sequence Field: /Page RISK\nFACTORS The\nfollowing is a summary of certain risks that should be",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
